# HANDOFF.md (placeholder)

Internal session log for the **dev edition** of Ascendo lives in
`dev-sync-overlay/handoff/HANDOFF.md` and is pushed to a private
Proton overlay via `dev-sync-export.sh`. It contains per-session
implementation notes that are useful to maintainers but not to
public users.

**Public users**: see [`RELEASE_NOTES.md`](./RELEASE_NOTES.md) and
[`CHANGELOG.md`](./CHANGELOG.md) for what shipped in each release,
and [`PLAN.md.example`](./PLAN.md.example) (if present) for the
high-level forward roadmap.

**Maintainers** setting up a fresh dev machine: run
`dev-sync-import.sh` to restore the real `HANDOFF.md` (and
`PLAN.md`, and the per-session specs in `docs/superpowers/specs/`)
alongside the rest of the dev-edition overlay.
